# React

- Keep pages as thin server shells; interactive pieces in `features/*/components` with `"use client"`.
- Forms: React Hook Form + `zodResolver` against schemas in `features/*/schemas`.
- Styling: Tailwind utilities + `cn(...)`. Theme tokens live in the global stylesheet. Do not hardcode new hex in components.
- Empty / loading / error copy should match nearby screens.
- Component tests run under jsdom. Setup: `src/test/setup.ts`.
- Component smoke tests: Testing Library + `user-event` where interaction matters.
